# title: Bonus certificate
# category: Structured notes
# underlyings: 1
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: Tracks the stock, but pays at least 120% if it never closes at or below 70% of its initial level.
#
# Notional 1000. Bonus level 120%, barrier 70% (daily closes). Once the
# barrier is touched the certificate is plain stock.

2027-01-04
    s0 = spot()
    hit = 0

schedule(2027-01-05, 2027-12-30, 1D, US, F)
    if spot() <= 0.70 * s0 then hit = 1 endIf

2028-01-04
    if spot() <= 0.70 * s0 then hit = 1 endIf
    if hit = 0 then
        pays 1000 * max(spot() / s0, 1.20)
    else
        pays 1000 * spot() / s0
    endIf
